{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b872d4f2df56dbeb74cb5a866bd9adb46a7514757b6c0dbf2f0425169cde7d2d", "ja": "（静香のPV撮影がクランクアップした！　新しい\n静香の一面を収めた、いい映像になったと思うが……）", "zh": "（静香的PV拍摄杀青了！\n拍下了静香崭新的一面，我想会是段好影片……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "320a7c458fec47b82642e9a2989216034558bf29bd1a8f712c545d77b00ab84a", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\n撮影、これで全部終わりですか？", "zh": "辛苦你了，{$P$}。\n摄影工作这下都结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fe8d61ac09b5d8f9ba579971938598be019a321d152d60352f9fe4144a4b6a72", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。お疲れさま、静香！\n長い撮影、よく頑張ったな。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。辛苦你了，静香！\n这么漫长的拍摄过程，你真的很努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "d3452117a1a01e3c6511fc0a53b7bb2ffbc69585687b55171e5e46842aeb0e6d", "ja": "お仕事ですから、これくらい平気です。\nあの、それより……。", "zh": "毕竟是工作，这点程度没问题的。\n倒是，我比较想请问……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc9bc66297671122184f08ac25fa197bf3e1d46553dc92d039a1e2ba6e97d49a", "ja": "このPVって、完成したものはいつ見られるんですか？", "zh": "这部PV的完成品，什么时候能看到呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1005_p", "source_sha256": "744076bd559b838b2f0c5abbbc907ab6a86d8aa390091ca95752a8628c683c7f", "ja": "これから編集だから、少し時間がかかると思うけど……\n必要なら、早めに見せてもらえるように頼もうか？", "zh": "因为接下来要做剪辑，我想会花一点时间……\n如果有必要的话，要我去拜托他们提早让你看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "cba50f7c49b564a865898688791adaf1f0d2aa01d50c8dcd4c36e3d047967dcb", "ja": "あ、いえ。{$P$}の手間がかかるだけ\nならいいですけど、他の方々のご迷惑になるなら……。", "zh": "啊，不用。只麻烦{$P$}倒是无所谓，\n要是给其他人增添困扰可就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1007_p", "source_sha256": "146b86eec18b0d94b365d4ecb38461eca1d74a8f0345735e5faa57c32eed8363", "ja": "（俺だけならいいのか……）", "zh": "（如果只麻烦我就可以吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "ac9b82283ce2ec293f13d3a2b065c599081983aa7ca88cb02935bfaa71847fe1", "ja": "あの、今回のPVですけど……\n{$P$}はどう思いましたか？", "zh": "请问，这次的PV……\n{$P$}你觉得怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8bfe256add522e26d44f9cd60b1a2d3e97bed65f89fc11643f3037756e2d66fc", "ja": "そうだな。このPVなら、ファンの人達に\n新しい静香の魅力を知ってもらえるだろうな。", "zh": "我觉得嘛，透过这支PV，\n应该能让粉丝感受到静香的崭新魅力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "c0176bcadc9df16910156c9c6e5e6f4f15519a563acdfa796e125c91c6a4fd36", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？\nあの、これからこういう仕事、増えると思いますか？", "zh": "真、真的吗！？\n请问，你觉得今后这种工作会变多吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3b705396691e1fb83788ff4067545cf83613ba311a6042f8e8b815a07b8e5f91", "ja": "もちろん。このPVは、きっと評判になるよ！\n嬉しいか？　静香。", "zh": "那当然，这支PV一定会大获好评的！\n静香，你很高兴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "d07e16a5a9b082d8b74c12f55f84f24b59c6ca6c49a186b95147cf24d4365657", "ja": "そ……そんなの、あたりまえじゃないですか！\nうれしいに決まってます。", "zh": "那……那还用说吗！\n我当然很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "b5af3c36db0d57b0745420fe277dcc2f434111eb545821418bcd9587dc103b3a", "ja": "憧れていたものが形になっていくたびに、\nアイドルになった実感が湧いてきて……。", "zh": "每当我所憧憬的事物逐渐成形，\n我就越有成为偶像的真实感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "7cf7703afc5af0412ad569c53686bc4cadff89258c01f0646aafff9cf20d2935", "ja": "私は本当に、アイドルになったんだな……って。\nもちろん、今で満足してなんかいませんけど！", "zh": "会觉得自己真的当上偶像了……\n虽说我当然不会满足于现况！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9dd7f2ab5cebcc4b6f68227a27c4f6bedc23ea005a84423881fdc9edb8dcf7f3", "ja": "そうだな。静香の憧れが、ちゃんと思い描いていた形に\nなるように、俺もしっかりプロデュースしていくよ。", "zh": "是啊，为了让静香的憧憬确实化作心目中的模样，\n我也会继续认真培育你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "996480d2bc3db9b87796eddd10828c158501061ea581d306b75b69460d13095b", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nあ、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n谢、谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "a4f0767e2fe99437833650d3e8568d642dea1e4a481e579abdab100200282748", "ja": "だからって、あまり無理はしないでくださいね。\n{$P$}に何かあったら、私……。", "zh": "话虽如此，请别太勉强自己啰。\n要是{$P$}出了什么状况，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4771b0a35dece0a91fb00c21708fbfa60e8d1de4cca7bca9b543758931f5aaac", "ja": "心配してくれるのか？　ありがとう。\n自己管理はしてるつもりだから、大丈夫だよ！", "zh": "你会担心吗？谢谢你。\n我有努力做好自我管理，所以没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "05adb3a01aaa1719bc1085a726f8778fbf787196932780cea90d869ff6d2d588", "ja": "え？　あ……ち、違いますっ！\nそんな、今のはそういう意味じゃなくて！", "zh": "咦？啊……才、才不是！\n哪有，我刚才不是那个意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "c41192da21bb75e58e19e6e1b746786a361b821cae5a6372b01d1ad90598d2b1", "ja": "私のために無理をしたとか、\nそんな理由で倒れられたりしたら、困りますから！", "zh": "我是说要是你为了我勉强自己，\n或是因此倒下了，我会很困扰啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0064_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "8ef6eb5fcb927a68b054c7f22a701df115b8ba2db0816ba09fcbe7e7a76c3cda", "ja": "それに、{$P$}の自己管理なんて、\n信用できないし。い、いい気にならないでくださいね！", "zh": "而且，{$P$}你的自我管理，\n根本就不能信任。不、不要太得意忘形了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
